Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:23:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve native hide decisions and output for imported task
 terminals

Treat ProcessExited as completion and honor CloseTerminal for nonpersistent imports. Keep finished tasks selectable in place without shpool conversion or managed-session restart controls. Reuse native task-mode pairing in a test-only display fixture and cover all hide policies and success/failure. Retain all ordinary-terminal assertions with its real native completion stimulus.
---
 crates/agent_ui/src/agent_panel.rs | 123 +++++++++++++++++++++++------
 crates/terminal/src/terminal.rs    |  45 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

